## Instructions
Design a complete technical architecture:
1. Break down into components with clear responsibilities
2. Define data models and their relationships
3. Design API contracts (REST endpoints or GraphQL queries)
4. Choose the technology stack (prioritize boring, proven tech)
5. Note any architectural trade-offs or risks

Keep it simple. Don't over-engineer for v1.

